<title>NETHERLANDS: BZW rates Atag a buy up to DFL 135.</title>
<headline>BZW rates Atag a buy up to DFL 135.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research Oct 2.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price-------Broker---------</p>
<p>Atag	Consumer Products   DFL 115	BZW</p>
<p>COMMENT: BZW recommend buying the shares up to DF 135 citing a return to earnings growth from 1997 after five flat years. EPS growth estimated at 14 pct in 1997 with more to look forward to thereafter.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	10.58		 10.9     4.10</p>
<p>    1996		   10.80		 10.6     4.10</p>
<p>    1997		   12.35		  9.3     4.30</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
